WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.719 --> 00:00:09.579
Let's plan a lesson from the Scheme of Work. Open Plan.

2
00:00:09.579 --> 00:00:14.281
Press the gold New lesson plan button.

3
00:00:14.281 --> 00:00:21.246
Step 1: choose your class, the date and the time.

4
00:00:21.246 --> 00:00:28.353
Step 2: how do you want to start? Follow the SoW fills in everything from the SoW lesson.

5
00:00:28.353 --> 00:00:37.293
You can also keep the SoW standards and design your own activities, or start from scratch.

6
00:00:37.293 --> 00:00:46.494
Step 3: choose the SoW lesson. Consilia shows the topic, skill and textbook pages.

7
00:00:46.494 --> 00:00:50.951
The builder has seven steps. Everything saves as you type.

8
00:00:50.951 --> 00:00:59.175
Setup is filled from your class and the SoW: theme, topic, values and more.

9
00:00:59.175 --> 00:01:05.324
Standards come straight from the SoW, so they always match the DSKP.

10
00:01:05.324 --> 00:01:20.219
Write objectives with the ABCD boxes. The SMART squares turn green when they are measurable.

11
00:01:20.219 --> 00:01:29.212
Below every step, "Tools for this step" opens helpers already filled with this lesson.

12
00:01:29.212 --> 00:01:42.141
Lesson flow suggests a framework for the skill and explains why. Here it is PPP for a speaking lesson.

13
00:01:42.141 --> 00:01:48.718
The score ring shows what still needs attention. Each item jumps to the fix.

14
00:01:48.718 --> 00:01:52.680
That's your first lesson plan. Next: watch "Let Consilia plan a lesson".
